{"id":1010204,"name":"嗷呜·审查Ⅳ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"嗷呜·审查Ⅳ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010204]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10204,"stage":"阶段4","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"你和嗷呜跟着贝格利下车，可是这座所谓的“村庄”如今却只剩下了沙幕之下的废墟和遍地干枯的杂草。","diary2":"在嗷呜的鼓励下，贝格利明白了这种与他家乡同名的珀利花作为一种重要的染料原料，至今仍存在于狄斯的很多地方。哪怕故乡不复存在了，这朵花依然能够带着家乡的期望、文化和回忆飞向各处。\n　　而在解开贝格利心结的同时，嗷呜也找到了先前那个问题的答案——她的身上始终都承载着家乡的文化，她也因此从未真正远离过家乡，而如今她回到狄斯，是因为她的朋友和珍视的人都在这里。","evidence":[{"ID":260341,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260342,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_i